  "result": {
    "text": "def change_base(x: int, base: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Change numerical base of input number x, to base. and return string representation of after conversion.\n    Base numbers are less than than 10.\n    >>> print change_base(x, 3)\n    '22'\n    >>> print change_base(x, 2)\n    '1000'\n    >>> print change_base(7, 2)\n    '111'\n    \"\"\"\n    if x == 0:\n        return '0'\n    result = []\n    while x > 0:\n        remainder = x % base\n        result.append(str(remainder))\n        x = x // base\n    return ''.join(result)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import doctest\n    doctest.testmod()\n```",
